# modules_c.tcyr — per-module suite, third part. Split from tests/modules_b.tcyr in 3.3.7: at
#                  908 KB that file was nearing cyrlint/cyrfmt's 1028 KB input cap, the cap
#                  3.3.4 split modules.tcyr for passing. It runs every group of the old
#                  modules_b from "3.3.5: perlin_2d / perlin_3d past 2^63" on, unchanged and in
#                  order. Same includes as modules.tcyr and modules_b.tcyr; only the tolerances
#                  and helpers its own groups use.
# The live assertion count is published per suite in docs/guides/testing.md.
# [measured: wc -c tests/modules_b.tcyr on the 3.3.6 tree, 908,223 B; the cap: CHANGELOG.md 3.3.4]

include "src/f64_util.cyr"
include "src/error.cyr"
