      0x3CD0000000000000)), 0x0000000000533333, "geo_ray_sphere: d = 2^1000, a subnormal t rounded once (3.3.5: NaN)");
# The capsule's ends more than DBL_MAX apart, (-0.9, 0, 0) and (0.9, 0, 0) * DBL_MAX, from
